WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.506 --> 00:00:02.585
(slurp)

00:00:03.195 --> 00:00:08.195
(upbeat guitar music)

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:17.788
- It looks really weird.

00:00:17.788 --> 00:00:20.414
- It's never come into my life,
I've seen it at restaurants.

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:23.925
- Whenever friends do try
it, I'm always hesitant.

00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:26.016
- I rarely went to a place that served it,

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:27.925
and then when I was there, I was like

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.654
"that looks too weird,

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:32.110
I'm gonna have the chicken
I can't pronounce instead."

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.242
- This is like, classic boba.

00:00:36.242 --> 00:00:37.158
- It's sealed.

00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:39.026
- I hope that it tastes
like chocolate milk.

00:00:39.146 --> 00:00:40.728
(popping)

00:00:42.318 --> 00:00:42.978
(gags)

00:00:44.278 --> 00:00:46.448
- It just felt like
tadpoles flew in my mouth.

00:00:46.448 --> 00:00:47.499
- I don't know how I feel about

00:00:47.499 --> 00:00:49.454
chewing these weird gummy things.

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:50.980
- It's like chewing on a trampoline.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.796
- I'm like, pleasantly surprised.

00:00:52.796 --> 00:00:53.942
- The tea is delicious.

00:00:53.942 --> 00:00:55.900
- It's very similar to this Indian ja.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.415
- I like it but I don't get it.

00:00:57.415 --> 00:00:59.712
- It's like expecting to get
a Game Boy for Christmas,

00:00:59.712 --> 00:01:02.047
and then your parents get
you a Game Boy Advance.

00:01:02.047 --> 00:01:03.257
- I would totally go for this again.

00:01:04.756 --> 00:01:06.295
- This looks like a witch's brew.

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:07.614
- I have no idea what taro is.

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:10.144
- Ooh, that's good.

00:01:10.144 --> 00:01:12.416
- I really like it, I like
it more than the first one.

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.595
- It's a floral, kind of
sweet potato kind of flavor.

00:01:14.595 --> 00:01:16.505
- Sweet but not too sweet.

00:01:16.505 --> 00:01:17.820
- Chewing on something matches

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.274
the flavor of what's going on here.

00:01:19.274 --> 00:01:21.613
- I would prefer the tea without the boba.

00:01:22.713 --> 00:01:24.595
- [voiceover] Honeydew milk tea?

00:01:24.595 --> 00:01:26.544
- This does not look natural at all.

00:01:27.584 --> 00:01:28.402
- This is really good.

00:01:28.782 --> 00:01:29.622
- Mm-mm.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:32.290
- (shrieks) Nooo!

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.812
- Whoa, that tastes exactly like honeydew.

00:01:34.812 --> 00:01:37.624
- So sweet and so sour at the same time.

00:01:37.624 --> 00:01:39.524
- It's not overly powerful,
it's not too sweet.

00:01:39.524 --> 00:01:41.829
- This makes the most
sense to chew the balls,

00:01:41.829 --> 00:01:43.765
cause you're used to chewing
when you eat honeydew.

00:01:43.765 --> 00:01:47.399
- I feel like honeydew
is done better in boba

00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:48.642
than it is like, on its own.

00:01:48.642 --> 00:01:49.754
- I'm liking it more and more.

00:01:50.494 --> 00:01:53.064
- Maybe I need to go out and
start drinking more boba tea.

00:01:53.064 --> 00:01:55.005
- It almost makes drinking tea stressful.

00:01:55.005 --> 00:01:55.888
- I'm a convert.

00:01:55.888 --> 00:01:56.838
- I like the squishy.

00:01:56.838 --> 00:01:58.885
- I would drink this
now. I'm glad I tried it.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.469
[voiceover] These balls confuse me a ton.

00:02:00.469 --> 00:02:01.622
I don't know whether to swallow them,

00:02:01.622 --> 00:02:04.156
or just like, let them
hang out in my mouth.

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:07.231
(laughs)

00:02:07.231 --> 00:02:09.581
It's impossible not to
make jokes about balls

00:02:09.581 --> 00:02:11.069
when you're drinking this tea.

